      "id": "claim_378d207f70234879b911da4884307fa4",
      "statement": "Model and application provenance requires five mandatory fields — HX alias, upstream identity, source URI, full artifact SHA-256, and import method — plus the verbatim Modelfile or build definition when the artifact was imported rather than pulled.",
